<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/eng@/~cl_23> <https://schema.org/text> "86A. section 86 the following new section 86A: 86A. Any person who hinders or obstructs any member, officer or servant of the Commission in the performance or execution of his duty or in carrying out anything which he is empowered or required to do by virtue of or in consequence of this Act shall be guilty of an offence under this Act and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding six months or to both.\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1993/2/eng@> .
